            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.25</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Menus open close to the screen edge</strong> — near an edge a menu now opens under the pointer. It moves in only when a folder or a pill points at the edge.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
