            <sparkle:version>0.18.24</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.24</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>The menu signs are white</strong> — the Main, Context and Window signs no longer come in blue, red and orange. If you never changed them, they turn white with this update. Colours you picked yourself stay.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
